```

Which statement correctly interprets the template structure and result?

You have the following ARM template fragment for a storage account deployment.

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "parameters": {
    "prefix": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 3
    },
